      "message": "Ok, for markdown http:// is added by markedjs. when called render[\u0027link\u0027] \n`href` is `\"http://www.google.com\"` and  `text` is `www.google.com` on line 227.\n\nWe add \u0027target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener noreferrer\u0027 when href is not same origin. Added by https://gerrit-review.git.corp.google.com/c/gerrit/+/372354\n\nIMHO since markedjs is already doing http, I would leave http. I haven\u0027t seen any bug around that.",
